#: conf.json:summary
msgid "Marks the place of an error under a rendered sequence (command-line arguments, tokens or a string) and prints it with a message."
msgstr "在渲染出的序列（命令行参数、词法单元或字符串）下面标出错误所在的位置，并连同错误信息一起输出。"

#: manual/api/core.md:1
msgid "core API"
msgstr "core API"

#: manual/api/core.md:5
#: manual/api/cursor.md:5
#: manual/api/error_report.md:3
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: manual/api/core.md:7
msgid "The root package of `KCN-judu/err_marker` turns a report (a severity, a message and marks on places) and a sequence (command-line arguments, tokens or a string) into a few lines of text: the line with the marks, a marker row, messages and the header. Its public surface is recorded in `src/pkg.generated.mbti`; the contract behind the columns is in the [design](../design/core.md). The 0.1 API, `ErrorData::mark`, is deprecated and listed at the end."
msgstr "`KCN-judu/err_marker` 的根包把一份报告（严重级别、信息以及位置上的标记）和一个序列（命令行参数、词法单元或字符串）变成几行文本：带标记的那一行、标记行、说明文字和标题。其公开接口记录在 `src/pkg.generated.mbti` 中；列宽背后的合约见[设计](../design/core.md)。0.1 的 API `ErrorData::mark` 已弃用，列在最后。"

#: manual/api/core.md:15
#: manual/api/cursor.md:13
#: manual/api/error_report.md:11
msgid "Importing"
msgstr "导入"

#: manual/api/core.md:17
msgid "Add the package to your `moon.pkg`:"
msgstr "在你的 `moon.pkg` 中加入这个包："

#: manual/api/core.md:25
msgid "The examples on this page call it as `@err_marker`."
msgstr "本页的示例以 `@err_marker` 调用它。"

#: manual/api/core.md:27
msgid "Sequences"
msgstr "序列"

#: manual/api/core.md:31
msgid "The text that an error is marked in: an array of elements joined by a separator, or a string."
msgstr "错误被标记在其中的文本：用分隔符连接起来的元素数组，或一个字符串。"

#: manual/api/core.md:38
msgid "The type is abstract; build values with `Sequence::from_array` or `Sequence::from_string`. The type parameter is the element type, which must implement `Show` when the sequence is rendered."
msgstr "这是抽象类型；用 `Sequence::from_array` 或 `Sequence::from_string` 构造值。类型参数是元素类型；渲染序列时元素类型必须实现 `Show`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:44
msgid "Builds a sequence from an array whose elements are rendered with `Show` and joined by `join`."
msgstr "从数组构造序列，元素用 `Show` 渲染，并用 `join` 连接。"

#: manual/api/core.md:51
msgid "`join` defaults to a single space. Positions in this sequence are element indices: position `i` covers the rendered text of element `i`. An element that is empty, or contains whitespace, a double quote or the separator, is wrapped in double quotes, with `\\` and `\"` escaped by a backslash, so the rendered line can always be split back into its elements; marks then cover the quoted token."
msgstr "`join` 默认是一个空格。这种序列中的位置是元素下标：位置 `i` 覆盖元素 `i` 渲染出的文本。空元素，以及含有空白、双引号或分隔符的元素，会被包在双引号中，其中的 `\\` 和 `\"` 用反斜杠转义，所以渲染出的行总能拆回各个元素；此时标记覆盖加了引号的整个记号。"

#: manual/api/core.md:76
msgid "Builds a sequence from a string. Positions in this sequence are Unicode scalar (character) indices; `utf16_to_scalar` converts a UTF-16 offset."
msgstr "从字符串构造序列。这种序列中的位置是 Unicode 标量（字符）下标；`utf16_to_scalar` 可以换算 UTF-16 偏移。"

#: manual/api/core.md:95
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "报告"

#: manual/api/core.md:97
msgid "The report API is new in 0.2.0 and replaces `ErrorData::mark`. Positions in a `Span` are element indices for an array sequence and Unicode scalar indices for a string sequence."
msgstr "报告 API 是 0.2.0 新增的，取代 `ErrorData::mark`。`Span` 中的位置，对数组序列是元素下标，对字符串序列是 Unicode 标量下标。"

#: manual/api/core.md:102
msgid "How serious a report is, ordered `Help < Note < Warning < Error`."
msgstr "报告的严重程度，顺序为 `Help < Note < Warning < Error`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:114
msgid "`name` gives the lower-case word used in the header."
msgstr "`name` 给出标题中使用的小写单词。"

#: manual/api/core.md:125
msgid "A primary mark is drawn with `^`, a secondary mark with `-`."
msgstr "主标记用 `^` 画，次要标记用 `-` 画。"

#: manual/api/core.md:129
msgid "A half-open interval `[start, end)` of positions, valid by construction."
msgstr "位置上的半开区间 `[start, end)`，构造时即保证合法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:140
msgid "`new` turns a negative end point into 0 and an `end` before `start` into `start`. `point(at)` is the insertion point `[at, at)`, drawn as one marker."
msgstr "`new` 把负的端点变为 0，把小于 `start` 的 `end` 变为 `start`。`point(at)` 是插入点 `[at, at)`，画成一个标记。"

#: manual/api/core.md:145
msgid "A place to mark: a span, a style, an optional message and a priority."
msgstr "要标记的位置：一个范围、一种样式、一条可选的说明和一个优先级。"

#: manual/api/core.md:159
msgid "Where marks overlap, each column goes to the higher priority, then the later start, then the earlier end, then the primary mark, then the message that is smaller in code-point order. The result does not depend on the order in which marks are added, and marks equal in every field count once."
msgstr "标记重叠时，每一列依次归于：优先级更高者、起点更靠后者、终点更靠前者、主标记、按码点序更小的说明文字。结果与标记添加的顺序无关，各字段完全相同的标记只算一次。"

#: manual/api/core.md:182
msgid "Renders the report on a sequence in the compact layout."
msgstr "以紧凑布局把报告渲染到序列上。"

#: manual/api/core.md:188
msgid "The output is, in order:"
msgstr "输出依次为："

#: manual/api/core.md:190
msgid "the line of text that holds the primary mark (the whole text when there are no marks), with tabs expanded by `model`;"
msgstr "主标记所在的那一行文本（没有标记时为全部文本），其中的 Tab 按 `model` 展开；"

#: manual/api/core.md:192
msgid "the marker row, followed by the message of the mark that ends rightmost;"
msgstr "标记行，后面跟着标记最靠右的那个标记的说明；"

#: manual/api/core.md:193
msgid "the other messages, each under the start of its mark, on as few rows as possible;"
msgstr "其余说明文字，各自放在其标记起点的下方，占用尽可能少的行；"

#: manual/api/core.md:195
msgid "the header `severity[code]: message`, with ` at line:column` (1-based) when the text has several lines;"
msgstr "标题 `severity[code]: message`，文本有多行时带上 ` at line:column`（从 1 开始）；"

#: manual/api/core.md:197
msgid "one `note: ...` line per note."
msgstr "每条附注一行 `note: ...`。"

#: manual/api/core.md:199
msgid "Marks that start on another line than the primary mark are not drawn. Spans are clamped to the sequence and snapped outward to grapheme clusters, and columns follow Unicode 18.0.0 widths (`@cursor`). With `color`, ANSI SGR colours are used."
msgstr "起点不在主标记所在行的标记不会画出。范围会截断到序列内并向外对齐到字形簇，列宽遵循 Unicode 18.0.0 的宽度（`@cursor`）。指定 `color` 时使用 ANSI SGR 颜色。"

#: manual/api/core.md:234
msgid "A command-line argument vector as a sequence: arguments joined by a space and quoted when needed."
msgstr "把命令行参数向量当作序列：参数之间用空格连接，必要时加引号。"

#: manual/api/core.md:243
msgid "The Unicode scalar index of a UTF-16 offset, for callers whose positions come from `String` indexing. An offset inside a surrogate pair counts that pair as not yet passed."
msgstr "UTF-16 偏移对应的 Unicode 标量下标，供位置来自 `String` 下标访问的调用方使用。落在代理对内部的偏移，视为尚未越过该代理对。"

#: manual/api/core.md:254
msgid "`rendered` is the text that `Report::render` draws for the sequence, with elements quoted when needed. `locate` gives the scalar span in that text where a span lands after the hull, clamping and snapping steps of `render`. Together they let other renderers, such as the [`error_report`](error_report.md) adapter, draw exactly the same places."
msgstr "`rendered` 是 `Report::render` 为该序列画出的文本，必要时元素会加引号。`locate` 给出一个范围经过 `render` 的凸包、截断和对齐步骤之后，落在该文本中的标量范围。两者配合，可以让其他渲染器（例如 [`error_report`](error_report.md) 适配器）标出完全相同的位置。"

#: manual/api/core.md:268
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "已弃用"

#: manual/api/core.md:270
msgid "Kept for the 0.2.x releases for compatibility. The tutorial's \"Migrating from 0.1\" section shows the replacements."
msgstr "为了兼容，在 0.2.x 系列中保留。教程中的“Migrating from 0.1”一节给出了替代写法。"

#: manual/api/core.md:285
msgid "The 0.1 description of an error. Replaced by `Report` and `Mark`."
msgstr "0.1 中对错误的描述。由 `Report` 和 `Mark` 取代。"

#: manual/api/core.md:293
msgid "Deprecated: use `Report::render`. It renders with the 0.2.0 engine, so columns follow display widths, but keeps the 0.1 units: the span is `err_pos` to `err_pos + err_offset`, both included; string positions are UTF-16 offsets and every character the span touches is marked; a negative `err_pos` means no position; a negative `err_offset` counts as 0. The last line is `gen_msg(err_type, err_msg)`, by default `Error(type): message`, and `marker` replaces `^`."
msgstr "已弃用：请使用 `Report::render`。它用 0.2.0 的引擎渲染，所以列宽遵循显示宽度，但保留 0.1 的单位：范围是 `err_pos` 到 `err_pos + err_offset`，两端都包含；字符串中的位置是 UTF-16 偏移，范围触及的每个字符都会被标记；负的 `err_pos` 表示没有位置；负的 `err_offset` 按 0 处理。最后一行是 `gen_msg(err_type, err_msg)`，默认为 `Error(type): message`，`marker` 取代 `^`。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:1
msgid "cursor API"
msgstr "cursor API"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:7
msgid "`KCN-judu/err_marker/cursor` computes where text puts a terminal cursor. A piece of text becomes a `Move`, moves compose like functions, and applying a move to a `Pos` gives the line and column where the text ends. Widths follow Unicode 18.0.0: grapheme clusters (UAX #29) and East Asian Width (UAX #11). The mathematics is in the [design](../design/cursor.md)."
msgstr "`KCN-judu/err_marker/cursor` 计算文本会把终端光标带到哪里。一段文本变成一个 `Move`，移动像函数一样复合，把移动作用到 `Pos` 上就得到文本结束处的行和列。宽度遵循 Unicode 18.0.0：字形簇（UAX #29）和东亚宽度（UAX #11）。其中的数学见[设计](../design/cursor.md)。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:21
msgid "The examples call it as `@cursor`."
msgstr "示例以 `@cursor` 调用它。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:23
msgid "Positions and moves"
msgstr "位置与移动"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:27
msgid "A zero-based line and column, in terminal columns."
msgstr "从零开始计数的行和列，以终端列为单位。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:38
msgid "How a piece of text moves the cursor, in one of three normal forms."
msgstr "一段文本如何移动光标，取三种范式之一。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:48
msgid "With $T(x) = t(\\lfloor x/t \\rfloor + 1)$, the next tab stop after column $x$ for tab width $t$: `Shift(k)` maps column $c$ to $c + k$; `Tab(a, b)` maps $c$ to $T(c + a) + b$ with $0 \\le a < t$; `Break(n, k)` maps $(\\ell, c)$ to $(\\ell + n, k)$. Moves can be matched on but only built through a `Model`, which keeps them in normal form, so two moves are equal exactly when they act the same on every position."
msgstr "设 $T(x) = t(\\lfloor x/t \\rfloor + 1)$ 为 Tab 宽度 $t$ 下第 $x$ 列之后的下一个制表位：`Shift(k)` 把列 $c$ 映射为 $c + k$；`Tab(a, b)` 把 $c$ 映射为 $T(c + a) + b$，其中 $0 \\le a < t$；`Break(n, k)` 把 $(\\ell, c)$ 映射为 $(\\ell + n, k)$。移动可以做模式匹配，但只能通过 `Model` 构造，它保证移动处于范式，所以两个移动相等当且仅当它们在每个位置上的作用相同。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:55
msgid "Models"
msgstr "模型"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:59
msgid "The layout model: the tab width and whether East Asian Ambiguous characters are wide."
msgstr "排版模型：Tab 宽度，以及东亚歧义宽度字符是否算宽。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:69
msgid "Moves are composed and applied within one model."
msgstr "移动在同一个模型内复合与作用。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:77
msgid "The defaults are tab width 8 and narrow Ambiguous characters. A tab width below 1 counts as 1."
msgstr "默认 Tab 宽度为 8，歧义宽度字符按窄处理。小于 1 的 Tab 宽度按 1 处理。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:89
msgid "The move that does nothing; `k` columns to the right (a negative `k` counts as 0); one tab; one line break to column 0. With tab width 1, `tab` is `shift(1)`."
msgstr "分别是：什么都不做的移动；向右 `k` 列（负的 `k` 按 0 处理）；一个 Tab；换行到下一行第 0 列。Tab 宽度为 1 时，`tab` 就是 `shift(1)`。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:99
msgid "`compose(first, then)` is the move of `first` followed by `then`. It is associative, has `identity` as unit, and satisfies"
msgstr "`compose(first, then)` 是先 `first` 后 `then` 的移动。它满足结合律，以 `identity` 为单位元，并满足"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:112
msgid "Applies a move to a position."
msgstr "把移动作用到位置上。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:114
msgid "Text"
msgstr "文本"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:122
msgid "Splits a string into extended grapheme clusters (UAX #29, Unicode 18.0.0)."
msgstr "把字符串切分为扩展字形簇（UAX #29，Unicode 18.0.0）。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:130
msgid "The display width of one cluster that is not a tab or a line break. A flag, an emoji ZWJ sequence and a cluster with U+FE0F are 2. Otherwise the base character decides: 0 for controls, combining and format characters, default ignorables and Hangul medial and final jamo; 2 for East Asian Wide and Fullwidth, and for Ambiguous when the model says so; 1 otherwise."
msgstr "一个既不是 Tab 也不是换行的字形簇的显示宽度。旗帜、emoji ZWJ 序列以及含 U+FE0F 的字形簇宽度为 2。否则由基字符决定：控制字符、组合与格式字符、默认可忽略字符以及韩文中声和终声为 0；东亚宽字符和全角字符为 2，模型要求时歧义宽度字符也为 2；其余为 1。"

#: manual/api/cursor.md:143
msgid ""
"`cluster` is the move of one cluster: `\"\\t\"` is a tab, `\"\\n"
"\"`, `\"\\r\"` and `\"\\r\\n"
"\"` are line breaks, anything else shifts by its width. `text` composes the moves of all clusters of a string; it is a monoid homomorphism."
msgstr ""
"`cluster` 是一个字形簇的移动：`\"\\t\"` 是 Tab，`\"\\n"
"\"`、`\"\\r\"` 和 `\"\\r\\n"
"\"` 是换行，其他都按宽度平移。`text` 把字符串所有字形簇的移动复合起来；它是幺半群同态。"

#: manual/api/error_report.md:1
msgid "error_report API"
msgstr "error_report API"

#: manual/api/error_report.md:5
msgid "`KCN-judu/err_marker/error_report` converts an `err_marker` report into a [`marianoguerra/error-report`](https://mooncakes.io/docs/marianoguerra/error-report) report, for programs that want its gutter layout, JSON output or fixes. It is the only package of the module that uses `error-report`; the design is in [design](../design/error_report.md)."
msgstr "`KCN-judu/err_marker/error_report` 把 `err_marker` 的报告转换为 [`marianoguerra/error-report`](https://mooncakes.io/docs/marianoguerra/error-report) 的报告，供需要其行号栏布局、JSON 输出或修复建议的程序使用。它是本模块中唯一使用 `error-report` 的包；设计见[设计](../design/error_report.md)。"

#: manual/api/error_report.md:22
msgid "Conversion"
msgstr "转换"

#: manual/api/error_report.md:30
msgid "Returns the converted report and the `Sources` that hold the rendered sequence under `name` (default `\"input\"`). Spans are located exactly as `Report::render` locates them and converted to the UTF-16 offsets that `error-report` uses. `Error` and `Warning` keep their severity; `Note` and `Help` become `Advice`. Marks keep their style, message and priority; notes stay notes. Render the result with any `error-report` renderer."
msgstr "返回转换后的报告，以及以 `name`（默认 `\"input\"`）保存渲染后序列的 `Sources`。范围的定位方式与 `Report::render` 完全相同，并转换为 `error-report` 使用的 UTF-16 偏移。`Error` 和 `Warning` 保持其严重级别；`Note` 和 `Help` 变为 `Advice`。标记保留样式、说明和优先级；附注仍是附注。可以用任意 `error-report` 渲染器渲染结果。"

#: manual/design/core.md:1
msgid "core design"
msgstr "core 设计"

#: manual/design/core.md:3
msgid "This page states the contract that 0.2.0 renders by, after recording the 0.1 model it replaces and where that model went wrong. The decisions are tracked in [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5)."
msgstr "本页先记录被取代的 0.1 模型及其出错之处，再给出 0.2.0 渲染所依据的合约。各项决定记录在 [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5) 中。"

#: manual/design/core.md:7
msgid "The 0.1 model"
msgstr "0.1 的模型"

#: manual/design/core.md:9
msgid "A report has three lines: the rendered sequence $s$, a marker line, and the message. The marker line is $p$ padding characters followed by $w$ marker characters, so the whole design is the choice of $p$ (where the span starts) and $w$ (how wide it is). The padding is a space for each of the first $p$ code units of $s$, except that a tab is copied as a tab, so the marker lines up whatever tab width the terminal uses."
msgstr "一份报告有三行：渲染出的序列 $s$、标记行和错误信息。标记行是 $p$ 个填充字符后跟 $w$ 个标记字符，所以整个设计就是 $p$（范围从哪里开始）和 $w$（范围有多宽）的选择。填充对 $s$ 的前 $p$ 个码元各放一个空格，但 Tab 会原样复制为 Tab，所以无论终端的 Tab 宽度是多少，标记都能对齐。"

#: manual/design/core.md:16
msgid "Arrays"
msgstr "数组"

#: manual/design/core.md:18
msgid "For elements $x_0, \\dots, x_{n-1}$ rendered as strings $r_i = \\texttt{to\\_string}(x_i)$ and a separator of length $j$, the rendered text is"
msgstr "设元素 $x_0, \\dots, x_{n-1}$ 渲染为字符串 $r_i = \\texttt{to\\_string}(x_i)$，分隔符长度为 $j$，则渲染出的文本为"

#: manual/design/core.md:25
msgid "If $\\texttt{to\\_string}(x_i)$ is empty or contains whitespace, a double quote or the separator, $r_i$ is that string wrapped in double quotes, with `\\` and `\"` escaped by a backslash. This makes the rendering injective: $s$ can always be split back into $r_0, \\dots, r_{n-1}$."
msgstr "若 $\\texttt{to\\_string}(x_i)$ 为空，或含有空白、双引号或分隔符，则 $r_i$ 是该字符串包上双引号的结果，其中的 `\\` 和 `\"` 用反斜杠转义。这使渲染成为单射：$s$ 总能拆回 $r_0, \\dots, r_{n-1}$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:30
msgid "A span from element $a$ with offset $k$ covers elements $a$ to $a + k$, and"
msgstr "从元素 $a$ 开始、偏移量为 $k$ 的范围覆盖元素 $a$ 到 $a + k$，并且"

#: manual/design/core.md:37
msgid "where $|r|$ is `String::length`, the number of UTF-16 code units. If $a < 0$, nothing is drawn. A negative $k$ counts as $0$, and $a + k$ is clamped to $n - 1$. If $a \\ge n$, the mark is the point after the text: $p = |s|$ and $w = 1$."
msgstr "其中 $|r|$ 是 `String::length`，即 UTF-16 码元的个数。若 $a < 0$，什么都不画。负的 $k$ 按 $0$ 处理，$a + k$ 截断到 $n - 1$。若 $a \\ge n$，标出的是文本之后的那个位置：$p = |s|$，$w = 1$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:42
msgid "Strings"
msgstr "字符串"

#: manual/design/core.md:44
msgid "For a string, the span from $a$ with offset $k$ covers code units $a$ to $a + k$, so $p = a$ and $w = k + 1$. The same rules apply with $n = |s|$: $a + k$ is clamped to $n - 1$, and $a \\ge n$ gives the point $p = n$, $w = 1$. If the span would start or end between the two code units of a surrogate pair, it is widened to include the whole pair, so a character is never split."
msgstr "对字符串，从 $a$ 开始、偏移量为 $k$ 的范围覆盖码元 $a$ 到 $a + k$，所以 $p = a$，$w = k + 1$。同样的规则在 $n = |s|$ 时适用：$a + k$ 截断到 $n - 1$，$a \\ge n$ 给出位置 $p = n$，$w = 1$。如果范围的起点或终点会落在代理对的两个码元之间，就把范围扩展到包含整个代理对，所以字符不会被切开。"

#: manual/design/core.md:50
msgid "Several lines"
msgstr "多行文本"

#: manual/design/core.md:52
msgid "If $s$ contains line breaks, let $\\ell$ be the offset where the line holding the start of the span begins. The padding then covers code units $\\ell$ to $p - 1$ only, the marker line is printed right after that line, and $w$ stops at the end of the line."
msgstr "如果 $s$ 含有换行，设 $\\ell$ 为范围起点所在行开始处的偏移。此时填充只覆盖码元 $\\ell$ 到 $p - 1$，标记行紧跟在该行之后输出，$w$ 在该行末尾截止。"

#: manual/design/core.md:57
msgid "Where the 0.1 model was wrong"
msgstr "0.1 模型哪里出了错"

#: manual/design/core.md:59
msgid "The 0.1.4 release fixed tabs before the span, ranges, newlines, quoting and split surrogate pairs within this model. What remained needs the contract below, which 0.2.0 implements; `ErrorData::mark` now renders by it too. The formulas measure length, but the reader sees columns. The two agree only when every code unit takes exactly one terminal column. Each known bug is a case where they disagree, or where the two sequence kinds disagree with each other:"
msgstr "0.1.4 版在这个模型内修复了范围之前的 Tab、越界、换行、引号以及切开代理对的问题。剩下的问题需要下面的合约，0.2.0 实现了它；`ErrorData::mark` 现在也按它渲染。公式量的是长度，读者看到的却是列。只有每个码元恰好占一个终端列时两者才一致。每个已知的 bug，要么是两者不一致的情形，要么是两种序列之间行为不一致的情形："

#: manual/design/core.md:67
msgid "Case"
msgstr "情形"

#: manual/design/core.md:67
msgid "What happens"
msgstr "发生了什么"

#: manual/design/core.md:67
msgid "Issue"
msgstr "Issue"

#: manual/design/core.md:69
msgid "Wide characters (CJK, emoji)"
msgstr "宽字符（中日韩文字、emoji）"

#: manual/design/core.md:69
msgid "one character is 2 columns but 1 or 2 code units; the marker drifts left"
msgstr "一个字符占 2 列，却是 1 或 2 个码元；标记向左偏"

#: manual/design/core.md:70
msgid "Surrogate pairs"
msgstr "代理对"

#: manual/design/core.md:70
msgid "positions are code units, so a caller counting characters points at the wrong place; spans are widened to whole characters, so nothing is split"
msgstr "位置是码元，所以按字符计数的调用方会指错位置；范围会扩展到完整字符，所以不会切开字符"

#: manual/design/core.md:71
msgid "Tabs inside the span"
msgstr "范围内部的 Tab"

#: manual/design/core.md:71
msgid "a tab gets one marker character although it moves to the next tab stop; tabs before the span are copied into the padding and no longer shift the marker"
msgstr "一个 Tab 会移到下一个制表位，却只对应一个标记字符；范围之前的 Tab 会被复制到填充中，不再使标记偏移"

#: manual/design/core.md:73
msgid "The 0.2.0 contract"
msgstr "0.2.0 的合约"

#: manual/design/core.md:75
msgid "0.2.0 measures columns instead of length. This section is the contract that the 0.2.0 code is written and tested against; the decisions and the rejected alternatives are recorded in [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5)."
msgstr "0.2.0 改为度量列而不是长度。本节是 0.2.0 代码编写与测试所依据的合约；各项决定和被否决的方案记录在 [#5](https://github.com/moonbit-community/err_marker/issues/5) 中。"

#: manual/design/core.md:80
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

#: manual/design/core.md:82
msgid "An array sequence has elements $x_0, \\dots, x_{n-1}$ and positions $0, \\dots, n$. A string sequence is read as Unicode scalar values $u_0, \\dots, u_{m-1}$ and has positions $0, \\dots, m$. A helper converts a UTF-16 offset $o$ into the number of scalars before it; an offset inside a surrogate pair counts that pair as not yet passed."
msgstr "数组序列有元素 $x_0, \\dots, x_{n-1}$，位置为 $0, \\dots, n$。字符串序列按 Unicode 标量值 $u_0, \\dots, u_{m-1}$ 读取，位置为 $0, \\dots, m$。一个辅助函数把 UTF-16 偏移 $o$ 换算成它之前的标量个数；落在代理对内部的偏移，视为尚未越过该代理对。"

#: manual/design/core.md:88
msgid "Spans"
msgstr "范围"

#: manual/design/core.md:90
msgid "A span is a half-open interval $[a, b)$ of positions with $0 \\le a \\le b$. Constructors make every span valid: a negative end point becomes $0$, and $b < a$ becomes $b = a$. A zero-width span $[p, p)$ is an insertion point."
msgstr "范围是位置上的半开区间 $[a, b)$，满足 $0 \\le a \\le b$。构造函数保证每个范围都合法：负的端点变为 $0$，$b < a$ 时令 $b = a$。零宽范围 $[p, p)$ 是一个插入点。"

#: manual/design/core.md:94
msgid "Clamping to a sequence of length $n$ is the map"
msgstr "对长度为 $n$ 的序列做截断，是如下映射"

#: manual/design/core.md:100
msgid "It is a retraction onto the spans inside the sequence: it is idempotent and leaves every span inside the sequence unchanged. A span past the end becomes the insertion point $[n, n)$."
msgstr "它是到序列内范围的收缩映射：它是幂等的，并保持序列内的每个范围不变。超出末尾的范围变为插入点 $[n, n)$。"

#: manual/design/core.md:104
msgid "Snapping to grapheme clusters"
msgstr "对齐到字形簇"

#: manual/design/core.md:106
msgid "Let $B \\subseteq \\{0, \\dots, m\\}$ be the extended grapheme cluster boundaries of the rendered text (UAX #29); $0 \\in B$ and $m \\in B$. For a position $x$, let $\\lfloor x \\rfloor_B$ be the greatest boundary $\\le x$ and $\\lceil x \\rceil_B$ the least boundary $\\ge x$. Snapping is"
msgstr "设 $B \\subseteq \\{0, \\dots, m\\}$ 为渲染文本的扩展字形簇边界（UAX #29），且 $0 \\in B$、$m \\in B$。对位置 $x$，令 $\\lfloor x \\rfloor_B$ 为 $\\le x$ 的最大边界，$\\lceil x \\rceil_B$ 为 $\\ge x$ 的最小边界。对齐定义为"

#: manual/design/core.md:115
msgid "With $e$ the inclusion of $B$ into the positions, $\\lfloor \\cdot \\rfloor_B$ is right adjoint and $\\lceil \\cdot \\rceil_B$ left adjoint to $e$: $e(\\beta) \\le x \\iff \\beta \\le \\lfloor x \\rfloor_B$ and $\\lceil x \\rceil_B \\le \\beta \\iff x \\le e(\\beta)$. Hence $\\sigma$ is a closure operator on spans ordered by inclusion:"
msgstr "设 $e$ 为 $B$ 到位置集合的包含映射，则 $\\lfloor \\cdot \\rfloor_B$ 与 $\\lceil \\cdot \\rceil_B$ 分别是 $e$ 的右伴随和左伴随：$e(\\beta) \\le x \\iff \\beta \\le \\lfloor x \\rfloor_B$，$\\lceil x \\rceil_B \\le \\beta \\iff x \\le e(\\beta)$。因此 $\\sigma$ 是范围在包含序上的闭包算子："

#: manual/design/core.md:127
msgid "A zero-width span strictly inside a cluster widens to that cluster. The three laws are property tests."
msgstr "严格落在一个字形簇内部的零宽范围会扩展为整个字形簇。这三条定律都是性质测试。"

#: manual/design/core.md:130
msgid "Order of operations"
msgstr "运算顺序"

#: manual/design/core.md:132
msgid "A mark on an array is first mapped to the text: element span $[i, j)$ becomes the scalar span from the start of $r_i$ to the end of $r_{j-1}$, the hull of the rendered elements. Every span is then clamped with $\\kappa$ and snapped with $\\sigma$, in that order, and only then turned into columns."
msgstr "数组上的标记先映射到文本：元素范围 $[i, j)$ 变为从 $r_i$ 开头到 $r_{j-1}$ 末尾的标量范围，即这些渲染元素的凸包。然后每个范围先用 $\\kappa$ 截断、再用 $\\sigma$ 对齐，顺序不变，最后才转换成列。"

#: manual/design/core.md:137
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "列"

#: manual/design/core.md:139
msgid "Each grapheme cluster $g$ acts on the cursor $(\\ell, c)$:"
msgstr "每个字形簇 $g$ 作用在光标 $(\\ell, c)$ 上："

#: manual/design/core.md:147
msgid "where $w(g)$ is the cluster width from the generated UCD 18.0.0 tables and $t \\ge 1$ is the tab width of the model, 8 by default. These moves form a monoid under composition. Every composite has exactly one of three normal forms: a shift $c \\mapsto c + k$; a tab move $c \\mapsto T(c + a) + b$ with $0 \\le a < t$, where $T(x) = t(\\lfloor x/t \\rfloor + 1)$; or a line break $(\\ell, c) \\mapsto (\\ell + n, k)$. The forms are closed under composition because $T(T(x) + b) = T(x) + T(b)$. Laying out a text is a monoid homomorphism from cluster sequences, and the column of a span is the move of the text before it applied to $(0, 0)$."
msgstr "其中 $w(g)$ 是由生成的 UCD 18.0.0 表给出的字形簇宽度，$t \\ge 1$ 是模型的 Tab 宽度，默认为 8。这些移动在复合下构成幺半群。任何复合恰好具有三种范式之一：平移 $c \\mapsto c + k$；Tab 移动 $c \\mapsto T(c + a) + b$，其中 $0 \\le a < t$，$T(x) = t(\\lfloor x/t \\rfloor + 1)$；或换行 $(\\ell, c) \\mapsto (\\ell + n, k)$。由于 $T(T(x) + b) = T(x) + T(b)$，这些范式在复合下封闭。排版一段文本是从字形簇序列出发的幺半群同态，范围的列就是它之前那段文本的移动作用在 $(0, 0)$ 上的结果。"

#: manual/design/core.md:157
msgid "Rendering"
msgstr "渲染"

#: manual/design/core.md:159
msgid "Array rendering is injective: an element is quoted exactly when its text is empty or contains whitespace, a double quote or the separator."
msgstr "数组的渲染是单射：当且仅当元素的文本为空，或含有空白、双引号或分隔符时，才给它加引号。"

#: manual/design/core.md:161
msgid "Several marks overlay as a semilattice (commutative, associative, idempotent). Where marks overlap, the column goes to the higher priority, then the higher severity, then the later start, then the earlier end, then the primary mark, then the message that is smaller in code-point order."
msgstr "多处标记的叠加构成半格（交换、结合、幂等）。标记重叠时，该列依次归于：优先级更高者、严重级别更高者、起点更靠后者、终点更靠前者、主标记、按码点序更小的说明文字。"

#: manual/design/core.md:165
msgid "Message rows are assigned greedily by left endpoint, which uses the minimum number of rows: the largest number of messages that overlap at one column."
msgstr "说明文字的行按左端点贪心分配，所用行数最少：即在同一列上重叠的说明文字的最大个数。"

#: manual/design/core.md:169
msgid "Compact layout"
msgstr "紧凑布局"

#: manual/design/core.md:171
msgid "`Report::render` draws the line that holds the primary mark (the primary mark with the highest priority, then the earliest start), then the marker row. The message of the mark whose marker ends rightmost follows the markers on that row, which is always free to the right of them. The remaining messages start under their marks, with the rows assigned as above. Marks equal in every field are drawn once, so overlaying is idempotent as well as commutative; the tests check every order of a set of four marks with ties at each level of the tie-break."
msgstr "`Report::render` 先画主标记（优先级最高、其次起点最早的主标记）所在的那一行，再画标记行。标记最靠右的那个标记的说明跟在该行的标记之后，那里右侧总是空的。其余说明从各自标记的下方开始，按上面的方式分配行。各字段完全相同的标记只画一次，所以叠加既满足交换律也满足幂等律；测试检查了一组四个标记、在决胜规则每一级都有平局时的所有排列顺序。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:1
msgid "cursor design"
msgstr "cursor 设计"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:3
msgid "The problem"
msgstr "问题"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:5
msgid "To put a marker under part of a line, a program must know the column where the text before it ends. Counting characters is not enough: a wide character takes two columns, a combining accent none, a tab jumps to the next tab stop and a line break starts a new line. The package models each of these as a move of the cursor and composes moves."
msgstr "要在一行的某一部分下面放标记，程序必须知道这部分之前的文本结束在哪一列。只数字符是不够的：宽字符占两列，组合重音不占列，Tab 跳到下一个制表位，换行开始新的一行。本包把这些情形都建模为光标的移动，并把移动复合起来。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:11
msgid "Moves"
msgstr "移动"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:13
msgid "Write $t \\ge 1$ for the tab width and $T(x) = t(\\lfloor x/t \\rfloor + 1)$ for the next tab stop after column $x$. A grapheme cluster $g$ acts on the cursor $(\\ell, c)$ as"
msgstr "记 $t \\ge 1$ 为 Tab 宽度，$T(x) = t(\\lfloor x/t \\rfloor + 1)$ 为第 $x$ 列之后的下一个制表位。字形簇 $g$ 对光标 $(\\ell, c)$ 的作用为"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:22
msgid "Composition of functions makes these moves a monoid. Laying out a text is the monoid homomorphism from cluster sequences that sends each cluster to its move, so the end position of $uv$ is computed from the moves of $u$ and $v$."
msgstr "函数复合使这些移动构成幺半群。排版一段文本，是从字形簇序列出发、把每个字形簇送到其移动的幺半群同态，所以 $uv$ 的结束位置可以由 $u$ 和 $v$ 的移动算出。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:26
msgid "Three normal forms"
msgstr "三种范式"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:28
msgid "Every composite move has exactly one of the forms"
msgstr "任何复合移动恰好具有以下形式之一"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:36
msgid "They are closed under composition. A line break forgets the column, so anything followed by $B_{n,k}$ is a $B$, and $B$ followed by a column move stays a $B$ with a new column. Shifts add. A shift before a tab move is absorbed by $T(x + qt + r) = T(x + r) + qt$, which keeps $a < t$. Two tab moves combine because $T(x)$ is a multiple of $t$, so"
msgstr "它们在复合下封闭。换行会忘掉列，所以任何移动之后接 $B_{n,k}$ 都是 $B$，而 $B$ 之后接列移动仍是 $B$，只是列变了。平移相加。Tab 移动之前的平移由 $T(x + qt + r) = T(x + r) + qt$ 吸收，从而保持 $a < t$。两个 Tab 移动可以合并，因为 $T(x)$ 是 $t$ 的倍数，所以"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:46
msgid "and $U_{a_2,b_2} \\circ U_{a_1,b_1} = U_{a_1,\\, T(b_1 + a_2) + b_2}$."
msgstr "并且 $U_{a_2,b_2} \\circ U_{a_1,b_1} = U_{a_1,\\, T(b_1 + a_2) + b_2}$。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:48
msgid "The forms are canonical: two different values act differently on some position. $S_k$ is strictly increasing, $U_{a,b}$ is constant on runs of $t$ columns that start at $c = t - a$ (for $t \\ge 2$), and $B$ changes the line. With $t = 1$ a tab is $c \\mapsto c + 1$, so the model represents it as $S_1$ and no $U$ ever appears; this keeps the forms unique."
msgstr "这些范式是规范的：不同的值在某个位置上的作用必然不同。$S_k$ 严格递增，$U_{a,b}$ 在从 $c = t - a$ 开始、每段 $t$ 列的区间上为常数（当 $t \\ge 2$），$B$ 会改变行。当 $t = 1$ 时 Tab 就是 $c \\mapsto c + 1$，所以模型把它表示为 $S_1$，永远不会出现 $U$；这保证了范式唯一。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:54
msgid "Widths"
msgstr "宽度"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:56
msgid "Cluster widths come from the Unicode Character Database 18.0.0, through tables generated by `tools/gen_unicode_tables.py`:"
msgstr "字形簇宽度来自 Unicode 字符数据库 18.0.0，经由 `tools/gen_unicode_tables.py` 生成的表："

#: manual/design/cursor.md:59
msgid "**Standard (UAX #11):** East Asian Wide and Fullwidth are 2, Neutral, Narrow and Halfwidth are 1."
msgstr "**标准（UAX #11）：** 东亚宽字符和全角字符为 2，中性、窄和半角字符为 1。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:61
msgid "**Standard (UAX #44):** General_Category Mn, Me, Cf and Default_Ignorable_Code_Point are 0."
msgstr "**标准（UAX #44）：** General_Category 为 Mn、Me、Cf 以及 Default_Ignorable_Code_Point 的字符为 0。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:63
msgid "**Convention:** Ambiguous is 1, or 2 when the model asks for it; Hangul medial and final jamo are 0; controls are 0."
msgstr "**惯例：** 歧义宽度字符为 1，模型要求时为 2；韩文中声和终声为 0；控制字符为 0。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:65
msgid "**Cluster rule:** a cluster takes the width of its first character, except that a flag, an emoji ZWJ sequence and a cluster containing U+FE0F are 2."
msgstr "**字形簇规则：** 字形簇取其第一个字符的宽度，但旗帜、emoji ZWJ 序列以及含 U+FE0F 的字形簇为 2。"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:68
msgid "Tests"
msgstr "测试"

#: manual/design/cursor.md:70
msgid "The laws are checked exhaustively rather than by sampling: for tab widths 1 to 4 and every text of up to four pieces drawn from a narrow letter, a wide character, a tab and a line break, the tests check associativity, identity, the homomorphism law, that equal actions give equal moves, and that `apply` agrees with stepping the cursor directly. Changing either composition rule for tab moves, or representing a width-1 tab as $U$, makes them fail."
msgstr "这些定律是穷举检查的，而不是抽样：对 Tab 宽度 1 到 4，以及由一个窄字母、一个宽字符、一个 Tab 和一个换行组成的、最多四段的所有文本，测试检查结合律、单位元、同态律、作用相同的移动相等，以及 `apply` 与直接逐步移动光标的结果一致。改动任何一条 Tab 移动的复合规则，或把宽度为 1 的 Tab 表示为 $U$，都会使测试失败。"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:1
msgid "error_report design"
msgstr "error_report 设计"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:3
msgid "Why an adapter"
msgstr "为什么做适配器"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:5
msgid "`err_marker` 0.2.0 draws one compact layout for sequences such as command-line arguments. `marianoguerra/error-report` draws reports over source files, with a gutter, several sources and JSON output. Rather than grow a second general renderer, `err_marker` converts its reports into `error-report` reports, and users choose the output they need."
msgstr "`err_marker` 0.2.0 为命令行参数这类序列画一种紧凑布局。`marianoguerra/error-report` 在源文件上画报告，带行号栏、多个源和 JSON 输出。`err_marker` 不再另做一个通用渲染器，而是把自己的报告转换为 `error-report` 的报告，由用户选择需要的输出。"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:11
msgid "Same places in both renderers"
msgstr "两个渲染器中的位置相同"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:13
msgid "The conversion does not recompute positions. It asks the sequence where each span lands with `Sequence::locate`, which runs the same steps as `Report::render`: the hull of the elements, clamping, and snapping to grapheme clusters. It then converts the scalar span into UTF-16 offsets with `Source::span_of_chars` of `error-report`. A mark therefore covers the same characters in both layouts, including whole emoji and combining sequences."
msgstr "转换不会重新计算位置。它用 `Sequence::locate` 询问序列每个范围落在哪里，该函数执行与 `Report::render` 相同的步骤：元素的凸包、截断以及对齐到字形簇。然后用 `error-report` 的 `Source::span_of_chars` 把标量范围转换为 UTF-16 偏移。所以一个标记在两种布局中覆盖相同的字符，包括完整的 emoji 和组合字符序列。"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:20
msgid "Mapping"
msgstr "映射"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:26
msgid "`Label::primary` / `secondary`, with the priority"
msgstr "`Label::primary` / `secondary`，带上优先级"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:27
msgid "notes"
msgstr "附注"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:29
msgid "Dependency"
msgstr "依赖"

#: manual/design/error_report.md:31
msgid "The adapter is the only package that imports `error-report`, but a MoonBit module declares dependencies for all its packages, so installing `err_marker` also fetches `error-report`. It has no dependencies of its own."
msgstr "适配器是唯一导入 `error-report` 的包，但 MoonBit 模块为其所有包统一声明依赖，所以安装 `err_marker` 时也会下载 `error-report`。它本身没有依赖。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "err_marker"
msgstr "err_marker"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "This manual documents version `v0.2.0` of `KCN-judu/err_marker`."
msgstr "本手册对应 `KCN-judu/err_marker` 的 `v0.2.0` 版。"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "`err_marker` shows a reader where an error is. It renders a sequence (the command-line arguments of a program, a list of tokens, or a string), draws markers under the places that are wrong, and prints messages and a header:"
msgstr "`err_marker` 告诉读者错误在哪里。它渲染一个序列（程序的命令行参数、一串词法单元或一个字符串），在出错的位置下面画标记，并输出说明文字和标题："

#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "A `Report` holds a severity, a message, marks and notes; `Report::render` turns it and a sequence into text. Columns follow Unicode 18.0.0, so wide characters, emoji and combining marks line up, and tabs are expanded. The `cursor` package exposes the column arithmetic, and the `error_report` package converts reports for `marianoguerra/error-report`. The 0.1 API, `ErrorData::mark`, is deprecated."
msgstr "`Report` 包含严重级别、信息、标记和附注；`Report::render` 把它和一个序列变成文本。列宽遵循 Unicode 18.0.0，所以宽字符、emoji 和组合字符都能对齐，Tab 会被展开。`cursor` 包公开了列宽计算，`error_report` 包把报告转换给 `marianoguerra/error-report`。0.1 的 API `ErrorData::mark` 已弃用。"

#: manual/index.md:26
msgid "Install"
msgstr "安装"

#: manual/index.md:32
